LOVA M4 Day 3-5 -- Self-healing population (Axiom 6)

  Problem:     starting from 5 WRONG variants, evolve to target=42
  Mechanism:   fitness-weighted reproduction + type-preserving mutation
  No training, no gradients, no prior knowledge of the target structure.

